# November 19, 2026: western and northern Saratoga County (Ballston, Charlton, Galway, Milton, Greenfield, Providence,
# Edinburg) and two Clifton Park hamlets, drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region sar). The Atlas had nothing
# in Charlton, Galway, Providence, Greenfield or Rock City Falls. This batch adds the Hawkwood mansion ruins in Anchor
# Diamond Park, the Hoyt lime kiln at Lester Park, the Granger glass factory site at Mount Pleasant, George West's mill
# hamlet at Rock City Falls and the trolley bed in Boice Family Park, the West house, Charlton hamlet, the West Charlton
# "Scotch Church", Calvary Church at Burnt Hills, the Packer farm and Barkersville store, the Copeland carriage shop and
# the Barker store at Beecher Hollow, the Batchellerville church, Smith's feed store at Elnora, the Jonesville Store and
# Grooms Tavern (the last two were rows in notes/sar_pgzb.md and LEADS.md).
# Sources were opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py); HMdb marker pages (tools/page.py);
# Register forms from NPGallery for Calvary Church, the Copeland Carriage Shop, the Packer farm and Jonesville Cemetery;
# Saratoga PLAN's Anchor Diamond Park page; DEC's Lake Desolation State Forest page and the 2002 draft unit management
# plan; Friends of the Kayaderosseras; the Town of Milton parks page; The Mansion of Saratoga's history page; the
# Charlton Historical Society; Lakes to Locks Passage and the Town of Clifton Park for Grooms Tavern; the Saratoga
# Business Journal for the Jonesville Store; Atlas Obscura and nnywaterfalls.com for what is seen.
from data_b import N
from data_ma import W
